            "description": "<p>Here are some of the stories Wall Street is watching on Monday, Aug. 25.</p>\n<p>Shares of Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) are rising ahead of the chip giant's Q2 earnings release on Wednesday, Aug. 27.</p>\n<p>JPMorgan upgraded Fabrinet (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FN\">FN</a>) shares to Overweight from Neutral.</p>\n<p>Vital Energy's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/VTLE\">VTLE</a>) stock is surging after announcing it was being acquired by Crescent Energy (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRGY\">CRGY</a>).</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
